## VACATION CARE INCURSIONS FOR KIDS!

Rhythm Culture's vacation care incursions are jam packed with loads of drumming singing and dancing. Experienced facilitators will tell real stories of&nbsp;their personal experience in African culture with&nbsp;African people. Vacation care programs are for school aged children aged 5+. Drum Sing Dance your way through the holidays!

View our [Drum Sing Dance Program](/drum-sing-dance-program/) to find out what incursions we offer, the benefits of our program, what we include in a session and what others are saying about our programs. Watch our [drumming singing and dancing in action!](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zcPZmbtX0L8&t=8s)

![Children dancing at a kindergarten incursion](/media/2019/02/RC-Kindy-601.webp)

{% columns layout="equal" align="top" %}
{% column %}
![A young girl playing an African drum](/media/2019/02/Wildlings-1389-Copy-e1550208082750.jpg)

During a [vacation care program](/drum-sing-dance-program/) children will&nbsp;learn about&nbsp;African instruments and how they are made. They will play the African drums and dance the rhythms of West Africa.
{% /column %}

{% column %}
![A boy playing a djembe outdoors](/media/2019/02/Wildlings-1436-e1549588253136.jpg)

There are five different vacation care incursions to choose from and multiple incursion bookings receive a package discount. Get down and groovy this year with dancing and drumming workshops that will have your children smiling, laughing, jumping and moving! There is loads of fun to be had!
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

